url: "https://github.com/kuotunyu/tw-filing-intelligence/releases/tag/v1.0.5"
abstract: >-
  Research software and committed evaluation artifacts for a preregistered feasibility study of
  multimodal RAG/VLM methods over Taiwan public-company filings. The recorded locked run scored
  6/33 against a 17/33 baseline; a post-hoc protocol-literal audit changes the baseline to 18/33
  and leaves the candidate at 6/33. The frozen verdict remains NO_GO. This repository is not a
  production filing assistant and is not investment advice.
keywords:
  - RAG evaluation
  - vision-language models
  - information retrieval
  - reproducible research
  - Taiwan public filings
  - negative results
